<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Father, how we love You,</l><l>How we worship You in Your one Body;</l><l>Father, how we love You,</l><l>How we worship You in our feasting;</l><l>By our eating this bread,</l><l>And our drinking of this one cup,</l><l>We do worship You, God,</l><l>Holy Father, as Your true worshippers....</l><l>True worshippers.... Father God!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
